Method channel 
---------------
platform is simply a MethodChannel object.

Its job is to provide the communication channel between Flutter and native code.


invokeMethod() is a function of the MethodChannel.

Its job is to send a request through that channel to native code.

MethodChannel('battery_channel')

platform.invokeMethod('getBatteryLevel');


